Fetched by hand (no FetchContent, no file(DOWNLOAD) — see README.md "why this
looks different from both pdfium and libsodium"). Re-pin by re-running:

    curl -fsSL -o third_party/httplib/httplib.h \
        https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yhirose/cpp-httplib/<new-tag>/httplib.h
    shasum -a 256 third_party/httplib/httplib.h   # update sha256 above
    curl -fsSL -o third_party/httplib/LICENSE \
        https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yhirose/cpp-httplib/<new-tag>/LICENSE

Used for both roles in this project: the HTTP server (`api/`) and the
outbound HTTPS client to the Anthropic API (`ai/remote`). HTTPS requires
`CPPHTTPLIB_OPENSSL_SUPPORT` + linking OpenSSL — see cmake/UappOpenSsl.cmake.
